            <title>[IGNITE-8682] Attempt to configure IGFS in persistent mode without specific data region ends with AssertionError</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8682</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;If persistence is enabled and data region name is not specified in IGFS configuration, attempt to access IGFS internal cache results in the following error:&lt;/p&gt;
